\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Detailed architecture of the sequence-enhanced structural expert. The structural expert integrates ESM2-enhanced residue semantics, a pLDDT-aware geometric residue graph, full-atom chemical-site message passing, and availability-masked conformer-ensemble statistics. Residue-level structural states are continuously modulated by node-level confidence before serving as keys and values in sequence--structure cross-attention. A peptide-level confidence gate further controls the fused structural context, while conformer statistics provide a zero-initialized logit residual only when valid ensemble information is available.}}{11}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:expert_detail}{{2}{11}{Detailed architecture of the sequence-enhanced structural expert. The structural expert integrates ESM2-enhanced residue semantics, a pLDDT-aware geometric residue graph, full-atom chemical-site message passing, and availability-masked conformer-ensemble statistics. Residue-level structural states are continuously modulated by node-level confidence before serving as keys and values in sequence--structure cross-attention. A peptide-level confidence gate further controls the fused structural context, while conformer statistics provide a zero-initialized logit residual only when valid ensemble information is available}{figure.caption.3}{}}
